<title>UK: M.Stanley/ABN AMRO lead Batavia asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>M.Stanley/ABN AMRO lead Batavia asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International (books) and ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BATAVIA CREDIT CARD CORP LTD</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    1.875     SELL CONC   0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	6.00 PCT DSL DUE JAN.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
